  <text>
    <status value="extensions"/><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p class="res-header-id"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-preferred-pronouns</b></p><a name="ahip-preferred-pronouns"> </a><a name="hcahip-preferred-pronouns"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href="http://loinc.org"><code>http://loinc.org</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class="none"><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://loinc.org/LA29518-0/">LA29518-0</a></td><td>He, him, his</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://loinc.org/LA29519-8/">LA29519-8</a></td><td>She, her, hers</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://loinc.org/LA29520-6/">LA29520-6</a></td><td>They, them, theirs (non-binary)</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://loinc.org/LA29523-0/">LA29523-0</a></td><td>Ze, hir, hirs (non-binary)​</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://loinc.org/LA29521-4/">LA29521-4</a></td><td>Ze, zir, zirs (non-binary)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href="CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html"><code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification"> version &#x1F4E6;0.1.0</span><table class="none"><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html#AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor-UMN">UMN</a></td><td>Use my name</td><td>**Description:**This code is to represent explicitly that the patient do not want a pronoun to be used but instead use their name</td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html#AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor-CNTR">CNTR</a></td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td><td>**Description:**This code is to represent explicitly that the patient has chosen not to respond to this question at this time</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><span title="Version is explicitly stated to be 4.0.0"> version &#x1F4CD;4.0.0</span><table class="none"><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>
